### 1. Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Get Me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
